{"posts":[{"kind":"announcement","links":["https://www.facebook.com/playriftbound/posts/pfbid02ZmFhBix2GWY3h4wiatcxGeN4XHLdZ1eCwynhGLMBFMoRi4kAMnq3R1j6sATY6WpLl","https://www.instagram.com/playriftbound/p/DfzhabWl3Jo/","https://www.youtube.com/post/UgkxUlVAS1ui2fjMWHB_jDabezaVDr-5XNFk"],"posted":"2026-11-16","source":"Riftbound","text":"As we gear up for Convergence Fest, we're excited to share that there's even more magic coming to your local game store. From December 9-15, participating stores will have an exclusive Ionic Spark battlefield to give away to players who play in events there. And that's not all — we're bringing…","tier":"official","url":"https://playriftbound.com/en-us/news/announcements/celebrate-convergence-fest-at-american-game-stores/"},{"kind":"announcement","links":["https://www.instagram.com/teamfighttactics/p/Df1_WqCl91T/","https://www.youtube.com/post/Ugkxz5jmx57fsaE1E3uNjWhxuu48t6Y7MGjz"],"posted":"2026-11-17","source":"Riftbound","text":"Co-streamers from around the world are joining us in Vegas for #ConvergenceFest! Make sure to catch their streams to score exclusive drops from December 11-13.","tier":"official","url":"https://www.facebook.com/playriftbound/posts/pfbid0akB99g2w7Cgh2EcrB2DMc1XjFTJo2hm8icGS9XKfEKbcLaYrs1fiQQ4qdqmyoinl"},{"kind":"announcement","posted":"2026-11-17","source":"Riftbound","text":"#ConvergenceFest attendees! Find everything you need to know about TFT and Riftbound Side Events—including how to sign up for casual competitive play, what's happening and when, and what prizes are at stake—at https://convergencefest.riotgames.com. Plan out your schedule before tickets drop tomorrow!","tier":"official","url":"https://www.youtube.com/post/Ugkx2IVqaEZQ90TyrSQDWb5Nz93dg_4bzI1H"},{"kind":"announcement","links":["https://www.youtube.com/post/UgkxX4n0PIl75Dkbu4Kgpj6GmJvBlEj7hYFz"],"posted":"2026-11-16","source":"Riftbound","text":"📣 Calling all Riftbound streamers worldwide! Applications to host a watch party for #ConvergenceFest from anywhere are now open: https://riot.com/CFWatchPartyForm","tier":"official","url":"https://www.facebook.com/playriftbound/posts/pfbid0nffuabQbyWStnVE3vscBozQsLMjj6XC4uUANuKrDxYkquE2vJeAHpsDm8oYKjJVNl"},{"kind":"announcement","links":["https://www.instagram.com/playriftbound/p/DfzoRKXF7Z2/","https://www.youtube.com/post/Ugkx2aRerBHOIalGcZfCk-w7arGLhQ0veLBB"],"posted":"2026-11-16","source":"Riftbound","text":"🎶 Bring the symphony home 🎶 We’re gifting this event-exclusive DJ Sona card to all #ConvergenceFest attendees as a token of our time together in Vegas!","tier":"official","url":"https://www.facebook.com/playriftbound/posts/pfbid0RSmHzKnnKbNBFwk2b8rHENdHmztoy5RouPMAk2hejMkT1yERFj4NWxqupVLSAZC8l"},{"kind":"announcement","links":["https://www.youtube.com/post/UgkxDX4Bs9gFFrfFq_dL2SJ1FHVg1MgXNDvx"],"posted":"2026-11-16","source":"Riftbound","text":"#ConvergenceFest is almost here! Tune in to the stream and come hang out with both TFT and Riftbound casters, including Riftbound game designers Vriss, Runeclaw, and PVDDR, all weekend long!","tier":"official","url":"https://www.facebook.com/playriftbound/posts/pfbid0J47cUrTNUFbXPDeuB7YqRWY98GBBimrQEET1WXSrhL7hr7u3JFjEjsvrX2E1hVHDl"},{"kind":"announcement","links":["https://www.youtube.com/shorts/SfCltJ21pqc"],"posted":"2026-11-16","source":"Riftbound","text":"omw to our local just to get 0-3'd in 2v2","tier":"official","url":"https://www.instagram.com/playriftbound/reel/Df0YqiaDwmz/"},{"kind":"announcement","posted":"2026-11-16","source":"Riftbound","text":"Registration for the Worlds 2026 Edition and T1 2025 Worlds Champion Player Bundle drawings is now officially closed! If you're selected, keep an eye on your inbox for an email from support@riotgames.com tomorrow, November 17. Good luck!","tier":"official","url":"https://x.com/playriftbound/status/2122383913318580597"},{"kind":"announcement","posted":"2026-11-16","source":"Riftbound","text":"We have very few passes left for Convergence Fest, and we heard from competitors that many of their supporters couldn't get a pass. These events are better with loved ones cheering you on, so instead of a Last Chance pass sale, we're giving competitors another chance to bring a plus one!…","tier":"official","url":"https://x.com/riftboundop/status/2122434709313470469"},{"kind":"product","links":["https://www.instagram.com/playriftbound/p/DfxjaQQHWEY/"],"posted":"2026-11-15","source":"Riftbound","text":"Avoid the Sunday Scaries and lock in your entries! Dr. Mundo says there’s only ONE day left to enter the Worlds and T1 Player Bundle drawings. Registration closes November 16 at 9 AM PST. Don’t miss out! https://riot.com/3QYxPVC","tier":"official","url":"https://www.facebook.com/playriftbound/posts/pfbid02mMsvSiirFsVji7XeHJGUBzAHTxog8VmzryrmHL2nCKeSZN4GKeKWnUWY7vZ2xtYal"},{"event":{"date":"2026-11-15","fee":"CA$10","format":"Summoner Skirmish","name":"Radiance Skirmish #1","place":"Skyhaven Games","time":"5:00 PM"},"kind":"event","posted":"2026-11-16","source":"Skyhaven Games","text":"Thanks to everyone for coming out for our first Radiance Skirmish, and congratulations to Jordan Merrick for winning the finals against Wysley Ng! Final Standings 1st - Jordan Merrick (6-0-2), 2nd - Wysley Ng (5-2-1), 3rd - Robbie McCallum (4-1-2), 4th - Connor Bryan (4-3-0), 5th - Andrew Xie (3-1-2), 6th - Evan…","tier":"local","url":"https://www.facebook.com/groups/1289633928950754/posts/1854364645811010"},{"kind":"product","posted":"2026-11-16","source":"Skyhaven Games","text":"For the Radiance Vaults - we've raffled off the purchase to: Kaitlin Kovacs, Chris Armour. Thanks! We'll do this again if we get some more.","tier":"local","url":"https://www.facebook.com/groups/1289633928950754/posts/1854080269172781"}],"run":"2026-11-17","store_events":[{"cancelled":false,"city":"Victoria","date":"2026-11-17","fee":"","format":"casual play","name":"Riftbound casual play","store":"Rotty's Creations","time":"5:00-8:00 PM","url":"https://www.facebook.com/RottysCr